  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f201ca7f57d3ab332a39d6e7e4133ac6, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPC 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  id: 
  lines:
  - Oh... Hello Wonderer! Are you trying to reach the castle too?
  - Apparently, this big gate is the entrance, but it's closed.
  - I've discovered there are three levers to be pulled in order to open it. But
    i'm so tired of this journey. I don't think i will be able to continue.
  - 'Another thing: have you noticed that big chest in front on the path to my left?
    I think it hides something powerfull...'
  summaryLine: Well... I think my journey ends here, good luck to you! Maybe you
    will be able to pull those levers
